---
title: "A field note"
date: 2026-05-01
---

This page sets a `title:` and a `date:` but no `author:` of its own, so its byline names
the site author from `_site.yml`. The fallback applies to a dated page only, and its
Scholar `citation_author` tag names the same person. An undated page with no `author:`
of its own shows no byline.
